sequenceDiagram
 participant S as Source
 participant E as Edge outbox
 participant C as Cloud ingestion
 participant D as Inbox and effect
 S->>E: Stable ID and payload
 E->>E: Durable commit
 E-->>S: Accepted
 E->>C: ID, hash and payload
 C->>D: Atomic inbox and effect transaction
 D-->>C: Committed
 C--xE: Final receipt lost
 E->>C: Retry same ID and content
 C->>D: Existing receipt; no second effect
 C-->>E: Matching final receipt
 E->>E: Remove pending; retain recovery archive
 Note over E,C: Carrier custody is not destination commit
